{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2023-04-03 17:26:00', 'title': 'BETTERINVESTING™ MAGAZINE UPDATE ON UNITED PARCEL SERVICE INC. AND TRUIST FINANCIAL CORP.', 'text': 'TROY, MICH. , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE EDITORIAL ADVISORY AND SECURITIES REVIEW COMMITTEE OF BETTERINVESTING MAGAZINE TODAY ANNOUNCED UNITED PARCEL SERVICE INC.\xa0(NYSE: UPS) AS ITS "STOCK TO STUDY" AND TRUIST FINANCIAL CORP.\xa0(NYSE: TFC) AS ITS "UNDERVALUED STOCK" IN THE JUNE 2023 ISSUE FOR INVESTORS\' INFORMATIONAL AND EDUCATIONAL USE.'}